        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "Expanded Detail Transaksi",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Klik sebuah card transaksi untuk melihat rincian datanya (expandable). Card yang aktif akan memiliki border kiri berwarna biru.\n• Data rincian dikelompokkan dalam 4 kategori (Detail Sections):\n  1. **General Information:** STAN, RRN, Auth Source, Risk Value, Currency & Balance\n  2. **Merchant & Location:** Name, Address, City/State, Country, Postal Code, Coordinates\n  3. **Network & Device:** HPAN, Terminal ID, Merchant ID, Client IP, Device ID, Issuer ID\n  4. **Security & Authentication:** Berisi grid badge status (PIN Auth, CVV Auth, 3DS Flag, Card Status, dll), serta indikator Cross Border dan VRM Score.",
          "color": "#10b981",
          "bg": "#f0fdf4",
